(7238699, 1121043, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Reality can sometimes be terrifying and scary. This image brings to mind those  3 woman who were held captive for so long in Ohio by a deranged individual. What they endured was horrifying. I''m glad they got out alive, but sad that they were not rescued sooner. This image of a woman held captive is very disturbing and I feel it is every woman''s nightmare.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Reality can sometimes be terrifying and scary. This image brings to mind those  3 woman who were held captive for so long in Ohio by a deranged individual. What they endured was horrifying. I''m glad they got out alive, but sad that they were not rescued sooner. This image of a woman held captive is very disturbing and I feel it is every woman''s nightmare.', '2014-07-08 13:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7238700, 1121207, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Yeah, he looks like he is about ready to pounce and rip someone open. I can hear the Gollum like hiss from here. Well done.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Yeah, he looks like he is about ready to pounce and rip someone open. I can hear the Gollum like hiss from here. Well done.', '2014-07-08 13:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7238702, 1120899, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>I can see the fear in her face. Setting and lighting is good. I think the image would have been even stronger if it was a more close up view so that the shadow of the axe is more prominent - I.E. a shot from just the waist up of the scared and hunted woman and the open door showing the portion of the stalker and the shadow of the axe. Still a good fearful effort - 7.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. I can see the fear in her face. Setting and lighting is good. I think the image would have been even stronger if it was a more close up view so that the shadow of the axe is more prominent - I.E. a shot from just the waist up of the scared and hunted woman and the open door showing the portion of the stalker and the shadow of the axe. Still a good fearful effort - 7.', '2014-07-08 14:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7238706, 1120781, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment<br/> <br/>Not a fear I suffer from, but do understand that some find spiders very scary so I will look at it from that viewpoint. Judging on the merits of the photo - very nice details and great B&amp;W tones that show off these two arachnids in chilling detail. Both spiders fill the frame so that one gets an up close and personal look at them - most especially the ones who would not want to be anywhere in the room with them. A great shot - 7.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment Not a fear I suffer from, but do understand that some find spiders very scary so I will look at it from that viewpoint. Judging on the merits of the photo - very nice details and great B&W tones that show off these two arachnids in chilling detail. Both spiders fill the frame so that one gets an up close and personal look at them - most especially the ones who would not want to be anywhere in the room with them. A great shot - 7.', '2014-07-08 14:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7238712, 1121136, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The human figure emerging from a plague of darkness is visibly marked by the virus even as he clings to the hope of survival by donning a gas mask. Yes, just the thought of something akin to the 1918 Spanish Flu pandemic is both scary and terrifying. Well done presentation of this scary thought - will have to find something happy to do to push down the scary thought of this.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The human figure emerging from a plague of darkness is visibly marked by the virus even as he clings to the hope of survival by donning a gas mask. Yes, just the thought of something akin to the 1918 Spanish Flu pandemic is both scary and terrifying. Well done presentation of this scary thought - will have to find something happy to do to push down the scary thought of this.', '2014-07-08 14:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
