(7239691, 1121145, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Now that is the most innovative and creative way I have ever seen an uncooked whole chicken (or turkey) to make a frightening and scary creature! This fiery demon with a beastly head and hand eyes is not what you wish to cross paths with anywhere or anytime. Nicely done...oh I mean horrifically done:-).</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Now that is the most innovative and creative way I have ever seen an uncooked whole chicken (or turkey) to make a frightening and scary creature! This fiery demon with a beastly head and hand eyes is not what you wish to cross paths with anywhere or anytime. Nicely done...oh I mean horrifically done:-).', '2014-07-10 22:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7239692, 1121213, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>If spiders are not frightening enough to those who have an extreme fear of them then this spider with the piercing cat eyes that stare straight at you tips the balance into sheer terror. I don''t have a fear of spiders but if one like this suddenly appeared in front of my eyes I would jump back and scream in fright.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. If spiders are not frightening enough to those who have an extreme fear of them then this spider with the piercing cat eyes that stare straight at you tips the balance into sheer terror. I don''t have a fear of spiders but if one like this suddenly appeared in front of my eyes I would jump back and scream in fright.', '2014-07-10 22:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7239693, 1121182, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>A good effort, but I think that there is a little too much that it borders on campy. Not that campy is bad, but I feel it takes away from the horror of the composition. Just my two cents. If you are going for more horror than camp, I think less is more. Just a suggestion: perhaps just a portion of the tub is visible with most of the shower curtain concealing what lies beyond. What is visible is a section of the white rim of the tub with bloody water and some blood stains on the tub. The profile of the rubber duck can be seen as a shadow on the curtain. The beak full of sharp teeth would be the only thing visible peeking out from the curtain.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. A good effort, but I think that there is a little too much that it borders on campy. Not that campy is bad, but I feel it takes away from the horror of the composition. Just my two cents. If you are going for more horror than camp, I think less is more. Just a suggestion: perhaps just a portion of the tub is visible with most of the shower curtain concealing what lies beyond. What is visible is a section of the white rim of the tub with bloody water and some blood stains on the tub. The profile of the rubber duck can be seen as a shadow on the curtain. The beak full of sharp teeth would be the only thing visible peeking out from the curtain.', '2014-07-10 22:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
